committer konrad-metric <konrad@metric.xyz> 1780687824 +0200

Split local git hooks so commits run format checks only and pushes run tests.
Important changes:
   - pre-commit hook - format checks only (forge fmt and Prettier); forge test removed
   - pre-push hook - re-runs forge fmt and Prettier, then runs full forge test suite
   - enable-git-hooks.cjs - relative core.hooksPath, chmod hooks executable, fail prepare on setup error
   - README - document pre-commit vs pre-push behavior and just hooks setup

Small changes:
    - just hooks recipe added; pre-commit runs forge before npm; hook error messages drop --no-verify hints; updated hook header comments
